OL,3,GNEWSAThunderstorm warnings continue for
OL,4,Aparts of UK with more rain expected
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Met Office yellow warning will remain
OL,7,Fin force for most of Thursday as heavy
OL,8,Frain and thunderstorms move northwards
OL,9,Facross the UK.
OL,11,FA broad swathe of England and Wales is
OL,12,Fcovered by the warning which is valid
OL,13,Funtil 22:00 BST.
OL,15,FDownpours will continue to bring the
OL,16,Frisk of flash flooding and travel
OL,17,Fdisruption, with up to 75mm (3in) of
OL,18,Frain possible in places - accompanied
OL,19,Fby large hail, lightning and gusty
OL,20,Fwinds.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
